messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\n"Stranger Things" is a popular Netflix show. If a Netflix show is popular, Karen will binge-watch it. If and only if Karen binge-watches a Netflix show, she will download it. Karen does not download "Black Mirror". "Black Mirror" is a Netflix show. If Karen binge-watches a Netflix show, she will share it to Lisa.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? Karen will share "Black Mirror" to Lisa.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain. I think the correct option is: A\n', 'Let\'s break down the information step by step to determine if the statement "Karen will share \'Black Mirror\' to Lisa" is true, false, or uncertain.\n\n### Given Information:.\n1. If a Netflix show is popular, Karen will binge-watch it.\n2. If and only if Karen binge-watches a Netflix show, she will download it.\n3. Karen does not download "Black Mirror".\n4. "Black Mirror" is a Netflix show.\n5. If Karen binge-watches a Netflix show, she will share it to Lisa.\n\n### Step-by-Step Analysis:.\n\n1. **"Black Mirror" is a Netflix show.**.\n   - This is given directly.\n\n2. **Karen does not download "Black Mirror".**.\n   - From point 2, if Karen binge-watches a Netflix show, she will download it.\n   - Since Karen does not download "Black Mirror", it means she did not binge-watch "Black Mirror".\n\n3. **Karen did not binge-watch "Black Mirror".**.\n   - From point 1, if a Netflix show is popular, Karen will binge-watch it.\n   - Since "Black Mirror" is a Netflix show and Karen did not binge-watch it, "Black Mirror" is not popular.\n\n4. **Karen will not share "Black Mirror" to Lisa.**.\n   - From point 5, if Karen binge-watches a Netflix show, she will share it to Lisa.\n   - Since Karen did not binge-watch "Black Mirror", she will not share it to Lisa.\n\n### Conclusion:.\nBased on the given information, Karen did not binge-watch "Black Mirror" and therefore will not share it to Lisa. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
