en \\( L \\) (Ben is loved by children).\n   - If \\( F \\) (Ben is funny), then \\( L \\) (Ben is loved by children).\n\n### Conclusion:.\n- If Ben is from The Simpsons (\\( S \\)), then he is loved by children (\\( L \\)).\n- If Ben is funny (\\( F \\)), then he is loved by children (\\( L \\)).\n\nGiven that Ben is either from The Simpsons or funny, and in both cases, he is loved by children, the statement "Ben is loved by children" is true.\n\n### Final Answer:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
