ried Thai chilies are a bakery (\\( B \\)), then they must be a hotpot (\\( H \\)) or spicy (\\( S \\)).\n- However, we also know that no bakery is spicy (\\( \\neg S \\) if \\( B \\)).\n- Therefore, if dried Thai chilies are a bakery (\\( B \\)), they cannot be spicy (\\( S \\)).\n\n### Conclusion:.\nSince dried Thai chilies cannot be spicy if they are a bakery (because no bakery is spicy), the only way the statement \\( (B \\rightarrow H \\lor S) \\) holds true is if dried Thai chilies are a hotpot (\\( H \\)).\n\nThus, the statement "Dried Thai chilies are a hotpot" must be true.\n\n### Final Answer:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
